strongest. The combination of acid stomach, mucosal immunity, and microbiome mediated colonization

91
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:54,000
resistance handles most common bacterial contaminants in outdoor water effectively. E.oli contamination that

92
00:11:54,000 --> 00:12:02,000
would cause severe illness in a human is typically handled by a healthy dog with minimal or no symptoms. Salmonella is

