112
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:33,000
stomach and immune defenses provide no meaningful protection against cyanotoxins, which are chemical rather than microbial threats. Dogs that

113
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:42,000
survive E.coli coli laden puddles all summer can be killed by a single encounter with a bloomaffected lake in August. The biology that handles

