00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:14,000
to clean water infrastructure were drinking from the same variable outdoor water sources that dogs drink from. They got sick more often than modern humans

132
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:23,000
from waterbornne diseases. But they also maintained immune systems that were continuously calibrated by those exposures in ways that modern human

133
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:31,000
immune systems are not. The trade-off between pathogen exposure and immune calibration that the dog's biology illustrates has always existed for

