00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:38,000
humans, too. We just resolved it in a specific direction by building water treatment infrastructure. The dog represents in a very real biological

135
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:47,000
sense the water relationship that preodern humans had for most of their evolutionary history. The immune architecture that makes the dog's dirty

136
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:56,000
