137
00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:08,000
by every microbial exposure they encountered. The modern human drinking clean water every day is the evolutionary anomaly. The dog drinking from puddles is the baseline.

138
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:15,000
Now, let's address one more dimension that almost never gets discussed in any account of canine water tolerance. The

