pathogen resistance. There is not enough breed specific water tolerance research to make confident claims about specific differences. But the expectation that

153
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:14,000
all dogs handle contaminated water equally well is not wellounded. Let's close with what is actually happening

154
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:23,000
when your dog drinks from a puddle synthesized into a coherent picture. The water enters the dog's mouth where lysosyme and other salivory components

