00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:31,000
provide a modest first defense. It passes into the stomach where pH around one kills the majority of the bacteria

156
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:39,000
present. The small intestine with its mucosal immune system calibrated by previous exposure provides the next

